#EXTM3U
# IPTVMac review playlist: open-licence test content only, no copyrighted channels or movies.
# All films are open movies by the Blender Foundation, licensed Creative Commons Attribution (blender.org):
#   Elephants Dream (2006) orange.blender.org | Big Buck Bunny (2008) peach.blender.org | Sintel (2010) durian.blender.org | Tears of Steel (2012) mango.blender.org
# The files are served by their public hosts (download.blender.org, archive.org, Wikimedia Commons, test-streams.mux.dev, demo.unified-streaming.com).
# IPTVMac sorts entries by URL path (/movie/, /series/), then by group-title, then by file ending (.mp4 .mkv .avi). Everything else is Live.
# Here the group-title decides: "Live demo" (HLS streams) -> Live, "Open Movies" and "Movie Trailers" -> Movies, "Series (demo)" -> Series.
# The Live entries are on-demand HLS streams: IPTVMac lists them as Live because nothing in the link says otherwise.
# Source: https://github.com/Goelir/IPTVMac (docs/review/ReviewPlaylist.m3u).
